=== STEP 5 · reactive agents: does the verdict change when the others react? 
  logged humans keep a median time headway of 1.81 s
  IDM driver, realism = distance between headway distributions (lower is better): T=0.6: 0.51, T=0.8: 0.43, T=1.0: 0.37, T=1.2: 0.34, T=1.4: 0.35, T=1.6: 0.38, T=2.0: 0.60, T=2.4: 0.89
  -> calibrated T = 1.2 s (W1 0.34); a driver that never reacts scores 0.87
